1
00:00:02,072 --> 00:00:05,917
Season six follows the sixth book, Babylon's Ashes.

2
00:00:06,052 --> 00:00:07,982
Marco Inaros and his Free Navy

3
00:00:08,002 --> 00:00:10,357
have wrecked Earth and seized the Belt.

4
00:00:10,377 --> 00:00:11,727
Now Earth, Mars,

5
00:00:11,747 --> 00:00:13,052
and the Belters who refused

6
00:00:13,072 --> 00:00:14,852
to follow him have to work together

7
00:00:14,872 --> 00:00:16,177
to stop him.

8
00:00:16,197 --> 00:00:18,627
Four stories: the Rocinante,

9
00:00:18,647 --> 00:00:20,327
Marco and his son,

10
00:00:20,347 --> 00:00:22,267
a pirate captain with a conscience,

11
00:00:22,287 --> 00:00:23,992
and the battle for the Ring.

12
00:00:24,012 --> 00:00:25,292
Spoilers ahead!

13
00:00:26,056 --> 00:00:28,461
Story one: the Rocinante.

14
00:00:28,481 --> 00:00:29,836
The crew is back together,

15
00:00:29,856 --> 00:00:32,531
with Bobbie and Clarissa now aboard.

16
00:00:32,571 --> 00:00:35,276
Their first job comes from Avasarala.

17
00:00:35,296 --> 00:00:37,226
They hunt down the Azure Dragon,

18
00:00:37,246 --> 00:00:39,101
the Free Navy ship that guided

19
00:00:39,121 --> 00:00:40,901
the rocks onto Earth.

20
00:00:40,921 --> 00:00:42,201
They disable it and bring

21
00:00:42,221 --> 00:00:45,001
its crew back to the Moon as prisoners.

22
00:00:45,021 --> 00:00:48,875
Earth, Mars, and the loyal Belters form an alliance.

23
00:00:49,585 --> 00:00:51,965
Then the Rocinante carries Fred Johnson

24
00:00:51,985 --> 00:00:53,640
to Tycho, for a meeting

25
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,290
of the Belt's leaders.

26
00:00:55,310 --> 00:00:57,765
Marco ambushes them on the way.

27
00:00:57,785 --> 00:01:00,120
Holden quietly holds back his weapons,

28
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:02,795
because Filip is on Marco's ship.

29
00:01:02,815 --> 00:01:04,045
They fight their way out,

30
00:01:04,065 --> 00:01:06,845
but the hard burn is too much for Fred.

31
00:01:06,865 --> 00:01:08,720
He dies of a stroke.

32
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:10,520
Holden takes his place at the table

33
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:12,856
and helps hold the Belt factions together.

34
00:01:13,565 --> 00:01:16,245
Story two: Marco and Filip.

35
00:01:16,265 --> 00:01:17,920
Marco calls himself the leader

36
00:01:17,940 --> 00:01:18,945
of a free Belt,

37
00:01:18,965 --> 00:01:21,315
but his war is going badly.

38
00:01:21,395 --> 00:01:22,675
When the alliance moves

39
00:01:22,695 --> 00:01:24,325
to take back Ceres,

40
00:01:24,345 --> 00:01:26,200
he strips the station of its food

41
00:01:26,220 --> 00:01:28,300
and supplies and leaves.

42
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:30,575
Millions of Belters are left stranded,

43
00:01:30,595 --> 00:01:31,725
and Earth and Mars

44
00:01:31,745 --> 00:01:33,175
have to feed them.

45
00:01:33,195 --> 00:01:34,325
Filip begins to see

46
00:01:34,345 --> 00:01:36,137
what his father really is.

47
00:01:36,876 --> 00:01:37,656
Filip was there

48
00:01:37,676 --> 00:01:38,881
when the rocks hit Earth,

49
00:01:38,901 --> 00:01:41,056
and he believed it was justice.

50
00:01:41,076 --> 00:01:43,156
Now he sees his father use people

51
00:01:43,176 --> 00:01:45,551
and throw them away, even him.

52
00:01:45,571 --> 00:01:47,301
When Marco turns on him,

53
00:01:47,321 --> 00:01:49,426
Filip finally walks away.

54
00:01:49,446 --> 00:01:51,226
He stays on Callisto and takes

55
00:01:51,246 --> 00:01:52,526
his mother's name.

56
00:01:52,546 --> 00:01:54,360
He is Filip Nagata now.

57
00:01:55,078 --> 00:01:57,733
Story three: Michio Pa.

58
00:01:57,753 --> 00:01:59,133
She is a Free Navy captain

59
00:01:59,153 --> 00:02:00,683
who joined Marco to fight

60
00:02:00,703 --> 00:02:01,903
for the Belt.

61
00:02:01,978 --> 00:02:03,183
But Ceres shows

62
00:02:03,203 --> 00:02:06,228
her that Marco only cares about winning.

63
00:02:06,288 --> 00:02:08,393
So she turns her ships around.

64
00:02:08,413 --> 00:02:09,518
Instead of fighting,

65
00:02:09,538 --> 00:02:11,443
they hand out stolen supplies

66
00:02:11,463 --> 00:02:14,310
to the colonies that Marco left to starve.

67
00:02:14,942 --> 00:02:18,417
Marco answers by sending ships to destroy her.

68
00:02:18,547 --> 00:02:20,127
Pa loses part of her fleet

69
00:02:20,147 --> 00:02:21,427
and many of her crew,

70
00:02:21,447 --> 00:02:24,027
but she refuses to go back to him.

71
00:02:24,047 --> 00:02:25,002
In the end,

72
00:02:25,022 --> 00:02:26,327
she joins the alliance

73
00:02:26,347 --> 00:02:28,077
for the final attack.

74
00:02:28,097 --> 00:02:30,052
She is proof that being a Belter

75
00:02:30,072 --> 00:02:31,302
and following Marco

76
00:02:31,322 --> 00:02:32,910
are not the same thing.

77
00:02:33,619 --> 00:02:36,499
Story four: the battle for the Ring.

78
00:02:36,519 --> 00:02:38,774
Marco holds Medina Station,

79
00:02:38,794 --> 00:02:40,849
and its rail guns can destroy any

80
00:02:40,869 --> 00:02:42,919
ship that comes through a gate.

81
00:02:42,959 --> 00:02:45,684
The alliance sends its fleets anyway.

82
00:02:45,714 --> 00:02:47,769
The Rocinante leads thousands

83
00:02:47,789 --> 00:02:49,469
of empty ships through the Ring

84
00:02:49,489 --> 00:02:51,194
to soak up the fire.

85
00:02:51,214 --> 00:02:52,844
Bobbie leads the boarding team

86
00:02:52,864 --> 00:02:53,899
to the guns.

87
00:02:54,609 --> 00:02:58,239
Bobbie runs into Martian marines guarding the guns.

88
00:02:58,259 --> 00:03:01,989
They belong to a rogue admiral named Winston Duarte.

89
00:03:02,009 --> 00:03:03,939
She stops the guns by blowing up

90
00:03:03,959 --> 00:03:06,189
the reactor that powers them.

91
00:03:06,209 --> 00:03:08,789
Then Naomi uses what she learned:

92
00:03:08,809 --> 00:03:10,514
too much mass in the gates makes

93
00:03:10,534 --> 00:03:12,314
the next ships vanish.

94
00:03:12,334 --> 00:03:15,717
Marco's fleet races into the Ring and disappears.

95
00:03:16,469 --> 00:03:19,549
Season six ends in an uneasy peace.

96
00:03:19,569 --> 00:03:21,574
Michio Pa leads a new union

97
00:03:21,594 --> 00:03:24,274
that controls traffic through the gates.

98
00:03:24,294 --> 00:03:26,124
The Rocinante crew goes back

99
00:03:26,144 --> 00:03:27,474
to freelance work,

100
00:03:27,494 --> 00:03:29,324
with Bobbie and Clarissa as part

101
00:03:29,344 --> 00:03:30,499
of the family.

102
00:03:30,519 --> 00:03:31,824
But far away,

103
00:03:31,844 --> 00:03:33,866
Duarte and his rogue Martians have made

104
00:03:33,886 --> 00:03:35,424
a home of their own,

105
00:03:35,444 --> 00:03:37,386
in a system called Laconia.

